# Keep the image hermetic: plugins are type-only-erased at runtime (import type { Plugin }), so
# OpenCode's bundled Bun transpiles the .ts sources in place — no node_modules needed in the image.
# Baking the local pnpm install would bloat the image and leak host-resolved deps.
**/node_modules
**/dist
# Test/sim harnesses are not part of the runtime image (the Dockerfile only COPYs config + plugins).
probe/
sim/
probe/probe-output.jsonl
*.log
